@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "应用代码" as App
participant "SqlSession" as SqlSession
participant "Executor" as Executor
participant "StatementHandler" as StmtHandler
participant "ParameterHandler" as ParamHandler
participant "TypeHandler" as TypeHandler
participant "ResultSetHandler" as RsHandler
participant "Database" as DB
participant "InterceptorChain" as InterceptorChain
participant "PageInterceptor" as PageHelper

note over App
  <b>开发者扩展点：Mapper 接口与 XML 映射</b>
  开发者编写 Mapper.java 接口和对应的 XML SQL 映射文件
end note

App -> SqlSession: selectList("com.xxx.UserMapper.select", param)
SqlSession -> Executor: query(MappedStatement, param, ...)
SqlSession -> InterceptorChain: pluginAll(Executor)
note right of InterceptorChain
  <b>扩展点：Interceptor (插件)</b>
  使用 @Intercepts 注解配置拦截签名。
  通过 Plugin.wrap(target, this) 创建代理对象。
  PageHelper 在此拦截 Executor。
end note

Executor -> InterceptorChain: pluginAll(StatementHandler)
note right of InterceptorChain
  PageHelper 的 PageInterceptor 在此拦截 Executor 的 query 方法
end note

Executor -> PageHelper: intercept(Invocation)
activate PageHelper

PageHelper -> PageHelper: 获取并处理 ThreadLocal 中的分页参数
note right of PageHelper
  <b>PageHelper 分页逻辑：</b>
  若检测到分页参数，执行 count 查询。
  然后修改原 SQL，拼接 LIMIT/OFFSET。
end note

PageHelper -> Executor: invocation.proceed() (执行原始或改写后的查询)
deactivate PageHelper

Executor -> Executor: createStatementHandler()
Executor -> StmtHandler: prepare(connection, transactionTimeout)

StmtHandler -> InterceptorChain: pluginAll(StatementHandler)
note right of InterceptorChain
  <b>扩展点：Interceptor 插件</b>
  可在此拦截 StatementHandler 的 prepare 或 parameterize 方法
end note

StmtHandler -> StmtHandler: instantiateStatement()
StmtHandler -> ParamHandler: setParameters(preparedStatement)
note over ParamHandler, TypeHandler
  <b>扩展点：ParameterHandler / TypeHandler</b>
  开发者可自定义 ParameterHandler 设置参数。
  可实现自定义 TypeHandler 处理特殊 Java-JDBC 类型映射。
end note

ParamHandler -> TypeHandler: setParameter(ps, i, parameter, jdbcType)
TypeHandler -> DB: stmt.setXxx(i, value)

StmtHandler -> DB: execute()

DB --> StmtHandler: executeQuery() -> ResultSet
StmtHandler -> RsHandler: handleResultSets(preparedStatement)
note over RsHandler
  <b>扩展点：ResultSetHandler</b>
  开发者可自定义结果集映射逻辑，或在 Interceptor 中拦截
  ResultSetHandler 的 handleResultSets 方法。
end note

RsHandler -> App: 返回 List<E> 结果

@enduml